# Rakish Crew watches the outlaws die even as it leaves the battlefield with them (CR 603.10a: "dies" triggers look back at
# what was on the battlefield as the event happened). Bot1 has the Crew, its Mercenary token and a Triton Shorethief (a Rogue);
# on turn 4 Bot2's Nevinyrral's Disk destroys every artifact, creature and enchantment at once. Each of Bot1's two outlaws
# triggers the Crew once: Bot1 gains 2 and Bot2 loses 2. The Crew itself is no creature, so it makes no third.

